<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/empire-of-japan"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Empire%20of%20Japan.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Empire of Japan</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Army officers stage the Mukden Incident, launching independent action in Manchuria</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/italian-empire"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Italian%20Empire.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Italian Empire</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Libyan resistance leader Omar Mukhtar is executed</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/canada"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Canada.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Canada</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Statute of Westminster confirms Canada’s legislative independence</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-rwanda"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Rwanda.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Rwanda</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Belgium deposes Musinga and installs Mutara III Rudahigwa</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/union-of-south-africa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Union%20of%20South%20Africa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Union of South Africa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Statute of Westminster confirms the Union’s legislative independence</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/negritude"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/N%C3%A9gritude.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Négritude</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Paulette Nardal and Leo Sajou start La Revue du Monde Noir, a journal in English and French</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/haile-selassie"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Haile%20Selassie.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Haile Selassie</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">He introduces Ethiopia's first written constitution on 16 July, providing for a bicameral legislature</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/work/great-sphinx-of-giza"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Great%20Sphinx%20of%20Giza.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Great Sphinx of Giza</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Egyptian government engineers repair the head with a concrete collar after part of the headdress fell in 1926</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/second-spanish-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Second%20Spanish%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Second Spanish Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Two days after the municipal elections, the Second Republic is proclaimed and King Alfonso XIII goes into exile</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/second-spanish-republic"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Second%20Spanish%20Republic.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Second Spanish Republic</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The new Constitution, drafted by a Constituent Cortes, comes into force in December</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/christian-democracy"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Christian%20democracy.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Christian democracy</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Pope Pius XI issues Quadragesimo Anno on the 40th anniversary of Rerum Novarum</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/religion/jehovahs-witnesses"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Jehovah's%20Witnesses.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Jehovah's Witnesses</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">At a convention in Columbus, Ohio, Rutherford introduces the name Jehovah's witnesses</span></li></ul></section>
